@startuml
!theme reddress-lightgreen

title CO2 Controller - UI State Diagram

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EDEDED
    BorderColor #666666
    FontColor #222222
}

[*] --> Menu

state Menu
state Info
state "Set CO2 Target" as SetTarget
state "Set SSID" as SetSSID
state "Set Password" as SetPassword
state Wait
state Status

Menu --> Info : select INFO
Menu --> SetTarget : select SET CO2 TARGET
Menu --> SetSSID : select SET NETWORK

Info --> Menu : SW0

SetTarget --> Menu : save OK
SetTarget --> Wait : invalid / save fail

SetSSID --> SetPassword : SW2

SetPassword --> Wait : save fail
SetPassword --> [*] : save OK / reboot

Wait --> Menu : SW0

Status --> Menu : user activity

note right of Status
15 s inactivity from:
- Menu
- Info
- Set CO2 Target
- Set SSID
- Set Password
- Wait

leads to Status.
end note

@enduml